{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRK9XKFF9FJ1G48RY8X00","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今日は寒くて雨の中、握手会に来てくださったみなさん、ありがとうございました！☺️\n \n \n みなさんの手がめちゃめちゃ冷たくて、心配になりました、、、。\n \n お家に帰ったらすぐ温めてくださいね！！\n 風邪をひかないように！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして今日は4部だけ、みーパンダをしました🐼\n \n ハロウィンが近いのでね！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして次はお花の紹介です🌷\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRM9FT9ARKJ1S6WH5G6JB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRNBDES9YPK1PJS6ZDHEE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRPKHRN5W2197WAXD6QB0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRQJECNSYQTG4AKW4T0AJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRRJ3GYEE5H8X7PHNXHGM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRSGNYJ0WNABR28FDZZZB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KRTHT7VYFYWZMAPB4NR0Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n たくさんありがとうございます😊😊\n \n ちゃんと一つ一つ愛を受け取りました✌🏻️\n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"}